			"Message": "feat(Air): Integrate shared telemetry pipeline and add Common dependency\n\nInitialize the shared dual-pipe telemetry system (PostHog + OTLP) at the entry point of the Air daemon (`Source/Binary.rs`) to capture boot errors and runtime metrics. This aligns Air with the fleet-wide observability standard, ensuring consistent tracking across Mountain, Cocoon, and Air. The implementation uses `Common::Telemetry::Initialize` scoped to the `Air` tier.\n\nAdd `Common` as a direct dependency in `Cargo.toml` to resolve the telemetry interface. Minor formatting cleanup in `Source/Plugins/mod.rs` to align with the project's whitespace standards.\n\nThis change establishes the foundation for unified error reporting and performance monitoring across the sidecar ecosystem.",
			"SHA": "fecdb8ac711839e4d3776d9f9db7d29326c0cf62"
