			"Message": "refactor(Air): Rename handler methods to follow PascalCase convention\n\nRename CLI handler methods and plugin trait methods to align with the project's PascalCase naming convention. Changes include:\n- CLI handlers: `handle_status` → `Status`, `handle_restart` → `Restart`, `handle_config` → `Config`, `handle_metrics` → `Metrics`, `handle_logs` → `Logs`, `handle_debug` → `Debug`\n- Plugin trait: `handle_message` → `Message`, `handle_event` → `Event`\n\nThis removes the `handle_` prefix, making method names shorter and more consistent with the standardized naming patterns used throughout the CodeEditorLand codebase.",
			"SHA": "b1e5a866e52c0241777cd0f0ebb8171eb4a3b4a2"
