			"Message": "docs(Air): Refresh CHANGELOG formatting and structure\n\nUpdate CHANGELOG.md with improved markdown formatting, clearer section organization, and enhanced narrative flow. Changes include:\n- Expanded header to describe Air's purpose as the background daemon sidecar\n- Reformatted v2.1 section with proper markdown list syntax and subsystem tags\n- Reorganized v2.0 module inventory into categorized bullet points for readability\n- Consolidated dependency section with inline formatting\n\nThe changelog now reads more cleanly and provides better onboarding context for contributors exploring Air's architecture.",
